menu "IQData gateway"
    config IQ_NTP_SERVER
        string "NTP server (empty disables synchronization)"
        default "time.cloudflare.com"
        help
            Hostname or IPv4 address of the site's NTP server. Static networks
            without DNS should use a numeric address. Events retain uptime and
            null UTC until an actual synchronization. Measurements stay in RAM.
endmenu
